<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 128.06 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 128.06 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 128.06 million rand of South African bonds on Monday after buying 12.71 million rand's worth last Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>The Bond Exchange was closed on Wednesday, Thursday and Friday last week for the Christmas holiday. It will be closed again on Wednesday for the New Years Day holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
